ina-s-upgraded-peru-trade-deal-takes-effect-widening-ties", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116759064285700096/JzgCMpyt?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116759064285700096/JzgCMpyt?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 185, "status": 200, "title": "China’s ‘Upgraded’ Peru Trade Deal Takes Effect, Widening Ties", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-01/china-s-upgraded-peru-trade-deal-takes-effect-widening-ties", "url": "https://t.co/EGXGMXyO3x"}]}, "id": "2116978529221100013", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 943, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"#China’s upgraded free-trade agreement w/#Peru took effect Sunday, expanding rules covering areas including e-commerce, global supply chains, competition policy &amp; the environment\"\nhttps://t.co/EGXGMXyO3x", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116978529221100013"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:24:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116974674441568689"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/nathanpmyoung/…", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/nathanpmyoung/status/2116943265702592519", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/EBaLpqUci5"}]}, "id": "2116974674441568689", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 15131, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116943265702592519", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Does anyone else who went to UT 20+ years ago remember a guy named Cliff who would come to campus once a year and argue to students (maybe Charlie Kirk-style tbh) that every word of the Bible is literally true and answer any question? Been thinking about him a lot lately. https://t.co/EBaLpqUci5", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116974674441568689"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:02:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116969238820794633"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/mattyglesias/s…", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/mattyglesias/status/2116933747563958496", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/nknppUfeFW"}]}, "id": "2116969238820794633", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 32155, "like_count": 535, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 10}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116933747563958496", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Moderates are pissed at Stevens because now, if AES wins by less than what might be expected under a blue wave, progressives have an extra out.\n\nFrustrating for them I suppose, but such is the fate you choose if you devote time to arguing online. Always a losing game. https://t.co/nknppUfeFW", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116969238820794633"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:53:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116936767714832780"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "More pharmaceutical companies are taking early-stage research to the country, but questions remain over safety and transparency.", "display_url": "bloomberg.com/news/features/…", "end": 96, "expanded_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2026-10-29/china-s-speed-in-clinical-trials-draws-drugmakers-roche-astrazeneca-novartis", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115973218213253120/rrOcnA8o?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115973218213253120/rrOcnA8o?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 73, "status": 200, "title": "China Upends Global Drug Development With Cheap and Rapid Human Trials", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2026-10-29/china-s-speed-in-clinical-trials-draws-drugmakers-roche-astrazeneca-novartis", "url": "https://t.co/chyngoNzpJ"}]}, "id": "2116936767714832780", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1358, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "China Upends Global Drug Development With Cheap &amp; Rapid Human Trials\nhttps://t.co/chyngoNzpJ", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116936767714832780"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:47:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116935154136461775"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 12, "id": "17974586", "start": 0, "username": "willystaley"}]}, "id": "2116935154136461775", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11450, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@willystaley What’s the word on kombucha?", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116935154136461775"}, {"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:43:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116934214335520777"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/xyDCt0CPIL", "end": 234, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2116934214335520777/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116933170910162944", "start": 211, "url": "https://t.co/xyDCt0CPIL"}, {"display_url": "x.com/biancoresearch…", "end": 258, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/biancoresearch/status/2116887789790982346", "start": 235, "url": "https://t.co/zUah14Igs9"}]}, "id": "2116934214335520777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 53, "impression_count": 27360, "like_count": 149, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 32, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116887789790982346", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Where AI stands after Friday.\n\nThe 7th-largest sell-off in the last two years, after rallying over 500% since ChatGPT's November 2022 release.\n\nAlso note, the all-time high was October 6, less than a month ago. https://t.co/xyDCt0CPIL https://t.co/zUah14Igs9", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2116934214335520777"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:21:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116928596497633755"], "id": "2116928596497633755", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2123, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1/ RIP Bill Nordhaus.\n\nWhen I was a grad student at Yale in the 00s a lot of the old school giants were still there.  James Tobin still occasionally came to seminars!", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116928596497633755"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:14:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116926765050511811"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/petesena/statu…", "end": 57, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/petesena/status/2116243133956796806", "start": 34, "url": "https://t.co/tjcY9C1LmR"}]}, "id": "2116926765050511811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2908, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116243133956796806", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is great!  Hooray for Claude https://t.co/tjcY9C1LmR", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116926765050511811"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-01T15:44:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116919329312895340"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/loubie/status/…", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/loubie/status/2116918488677658728", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/EHxAbtOTee"}]}, "id": "2116919329312895340", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 51, "impression_count": 44133, "like_count": 483, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 10}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116918488677658728", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "My $0.02\n\n1) The rationalist/EA world has had far better intuitions about AI than the vast majority of the public for a very long time.\n\n2) Anyone who's been practicing their argument for years WILL beat you in an argument, but that's distinct from them actually being right. https://t.co/EHxAbtOTee", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116919329312895340"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-01T15:36:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116917361790116216"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/steven_b_falk/…", "end": 204, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/steven_b_falk/status/2116913837006004679", "start": 181, "url": "https://t.co/PQ5yDO55x8"}]}, "id": "2116917361790116216", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 11923, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116913837006004679", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Funny the whole reason I was thinking about this is that I just watched the Sopranos episode where they made a big deal of Hunter Scangarelo getting accepted early to Reed College. https://t.co/PQ5yDO55x8", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116917361790116216"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-01T15:31:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116916008145305785"], "id": "2116916008145305785", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 16013, "like_count": 221, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "NYC marathon day. Best of luck to all the sign-holders. Hope yours goes viral.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116916008145305785"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-11-01T15:29:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116915439024455977"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 40, "start": 34, "tag": "China"}], "urls": [{"description": "Archion chief says repair network offers competitive strength  after Thai floods bring service quality to fore", "display_url": "ft.com/content/7e7497…", "end": 228, "expanded_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/7e749777-dcee-4c11-9bdc-7f81bee80455", "images": [{"height": 394, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116823378577276928/RnrjSXVP?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 700}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116823378577276928/RnrjSXVP?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 205, "status": 200, "title": "Toyota-backed truckmaker bets on aftersales service to fend off Chinese EV rivals", "unwound_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/7e749777-dcee-4c11-9bdc-7f81bee80455", "url": "https://t.co/P7T48vJuV2"}]}, "id": "2116915439024455977", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1291, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"Established truckmakers can slow #China’s relentless export push by pitching customers on their extensive repair &amp; maintenance networks, said the head of a Toyota-backed heavy-duty vehicles producer\"\nhttps://t.co/P7T48vJuV2", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116915439024455977"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:57:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116907552336400466"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jessi_cata/sta…", "end": 271, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jessi_cata/status/2116666792814989585", "start": 248, "url": "https://t.co/r92jZ7q7xV"}]}, "id": "2116907552336400466", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 41, "impression_count": 37714, "like_count": 283, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 33, "retweet_count": 10}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116666792814989585", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This post says the AI safety movement is becoming a scene where people compete to out-doom each other, and sound overly pessimistic, when in fact some highly respected forecasters think the odds of humanity surviving could be anywhere from 10-40%. https://t.co/r92jZ7q7xV", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116907552336400466"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:49:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116905349672538289"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 76, "id": "118783936", "start": 61, "username": "keds_economist"}], "urls": [{"description": "Starting Nov 6 at 12:00 PM EST", "display_url": "open.substack.com/live-stream/42…", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://open.substack.com/live-stream/428299", "images": [{"height": 480, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116905393322651648/NVOb4EG_?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116905393322651648/NVOb4EG_?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 257, "status": 200, "title": "LIVE SOON: Jobs Day with Guy and Keds", "unwound_url": "https://open.substack.com/live-stream/428299", "url": "https://t.co/6F5QbNHiRe"}]}, "id": "2116905349672538289", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1387, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "At 9 AM PT on Friday November 6th, me &amp; the ONE AND ONLY @keds_economist will be doing our usual fun BLS chit-chat.\n\nKathryn Anne started a tradition of exotic locations, last week was DC and I bet you can't wait to find out where she'll be on Friday!\n\nhttps://t.co/6F5QbNHiRe", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116905349672538289"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:43:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116903940520604007"], "id": "2116903940520604007", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2267, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It’s Ruby-crowned kinglet season!", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116903940520604007"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:24:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116899185631064544"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/vo3xLaVx8Q", "end": 171, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116899185631064544/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116899180883181569", "start": 148, "url": "https://t.co/vo3xLaVx8Q"}]}, "id": "2116899185631064544", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 7584, "like_count": 77, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Roddenberry’s rule was absolutely bananas and one of the reasons TNG ended up being a good show is that the writers ended up circumventing it a lot https://t.co/vo3xLaVx8Q", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116899185631064544"}, {"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:39:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116887789790982346"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/W1xlMBPC8L", "end": 67, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2116887789790982346/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116887748988542976", "start": 44, "url": "https://t.co/W1xlMBPC8L"}]}, "id": "2116887789790982346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 202, "impression_count": 118671, "like_count": 809, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 64, "retweet_count": 75}, "text": "Where the stock market stands after Friday. https://t.co/W1xlMBPC8L", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2116887789790982346"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:24:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116853760139903172"], "id": "2116853760139903172", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 89, "impression_count": 23342, "like_count": 150, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 28}, "text": "I recently cited Sven Beckert's very good book on the history of cotton production in which he argued that capitalism and globalization occurred together. In this interview he argues that the issue today is no longer the problem of production, which has historically always been", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2116853760139903172"}, {"author_id": "30034124", "created_at": "2026-11-01T08:48:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116814503782281685"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "As America’s particle physics laboratory builds components for its powerful new linear accelerator, engineers 